This repository contains the source code for the NexusMods Bypass browser extension (the
"Software").

This licence does not apply to src/content/nnw.js. That file is based on Nexus No Wait ++
by Torkelicious and is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at
your option) any later version (GPL-3.0-or-later). Its licence text is included at
src/LICENSE-GPL-3.0-or-later.txt, and its attribution is documented in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. For the purposes of this licence, "Software" excludes
src/content/nnw.js.

The Software is source-available, NOT open source. The source is published so that anyone
can read and audit exactly what the extensions do. Publishing it does not place it in the
public domain and does not grant permission to reuse it.


